 ⚡ Circularity Fuels , a Redwood City, Calif.-based startup turning biogas into jet fuel, raised $7m in seed funding, per Axios Pro . DCVC and Trucks VC led, joined by Automotive Ventures and Sum Ventures. axios.link/4sFHz5w 

 • Shackleton AI , a NYC-based OS for construction, raised $5m in seed funding. Battery Ventures led, joined by Brick &amp; Mortar Ventures, Trust Ventures, Correlation Ventures, Motivate Partners, Thayer Investment Partners, Act One Ventures, Brainstorm Ventures, and Silence VC. axios.link/4sELEqI 

